"bold\">G</text><line x1=\"121.5\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"121.5\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"128.5\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"128.5\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"159.5\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"159.5\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"166.5\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"166.5\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"194\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"194\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"201\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"201\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"208\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"208\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"232\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"239\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"239\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"246\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"246\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"277\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"277\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"284\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"284\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"311.5\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"311.5\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"318.5\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"318.5\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"349.5\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"349.5\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"356.5\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"356.5\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"384\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"384\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"391\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"391\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><line x1=\"398\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"398\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><text x=\"212\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0e7490\" font-weight=\"bold\">A–T arasında 2, G–C arasında 3 bağ</text></svg><figcaption>Her bazın karşısında eşi bulunur; kesikli çizgiler zayıf hidrojen bağlarını gösterir.</figcaption></figure><table class=\"sv-c\"><tr><td>A</td><td>1. ipliğin aynısı yazılmış; 2. iplik tamamlayıcıdır.</td></tr><tr><td>B</td><td>A–G, T–C eşleştirilmiş; kurala aykırı.</td></tr><tr><td>C</td><td>4. kutuda G’nin karşısına G yazılmış.</td></tr><tr class=\"ok\"><td>D</td><td>A T G C C T A G → doğru.</td></tr></table><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Karşı ipliği yazarken harfleri çiftler hâlinde düşün: “AT” ve “GC” kelimeleri.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>D</b></div></div>"
