   "lv": "zor",
   "q": "<p>Bir DNA molekülünün belirli bir bölgesinde <b>timin–adenin</b> baz çifti bulunmaktadır. Bu DNA'nın 1. eşlenmesi sırasında yeni zincirlerden birinde, timinin karşısına adenin yerine yanlışlıkla <b>guanin</b> yerleşmiş ve bu hata onarım enzimleri tarafından fark edilmemiştir.</p>\n<div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 420 195\" width=\"420\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Eşlenme sırasında oluşan onarılmamış hata\"><defs><marker id=\"a12\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#475569\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"70\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Başlangıçtaki DNA</text><rect x=\"53\" y=\"40\" width=\"34\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#dbeafe\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">T</text><rect x=\"53\" y=\"74\" width=\"34\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#dbeafe\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">A</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"66\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"74\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"115\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"185\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#a12)\"/><line x1=\"115\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"185\" y2=\"125\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#a12)\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#475569\">1. eşlenme</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">1. eşlenme sonucu</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"25\" width=\"34\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#dbeafe\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\"/><text x=\"217\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">T</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"59\" width=\"34\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#ffedd5\" stroke=\"#c2410c\"/><text x=\"217\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">G</text><line x1=\"217\" y1=\"51\" x2=\"217\" y2=\"59\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"245\" y=\"45\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#475569\">← eski zincir</text><text x=\"245\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">← yeni zincir (hatalı baz,</text><text x=\"258\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">onarılmadı)</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"120\" width=\"34\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#dbeafe\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\"/><text x=\"217\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">A</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"154\" width=\"34\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#ffedd5\" stroke=\"#c2410c\"/><text x=\"217\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">T</text><line x1=\"217\" y1=\"146\" x2=\"217\" y2=\"154\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"245\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#475569\">← eski zincir</text><text x=\"245\" y=\"175\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#475569\">← yeni zincir</text></svg></div>\n<p>Oluşan iki DNA molekülü ve bunlardan oluşan moleküller art arda <b>2 kez daha</b> eşleniyor. Bu eşlenmelerde başka hiçbir hata oluşmuyor.</p>\n<p><b>Buna göre 3. eşlenme sonunda oluşan 8 DNA molekülünden kaçında bu bölgede, timin–adenin yerine guanin–sitozin baz çifti bulunur?</b></p>",
